2. Each of the following offences is prescribed as a compoundable offence that may be compounded in accordance with section 17D of the Act:
(a)an offence under section 16GA(1)(a), 17H(1) or 17J(1) or (2) of the Act, except a continuing offence;
[S 605/2026 wef 15/09/2026]
(b)an offence under section 16GA(1)(b), (c) or (d) or 17H(3) of the Act;
[S 605/2026 wef 15/09/2026]
(c)an offence under section 17L(1) of the Act (as in force immediately before 15 September 2026), except a continuing offence;
[S 605/2026 wef 15/09/2026]
(d)an offence under section 17K(3) of the Act (as in force immediately before 15 September 2026);
[S 605/2026 wef 15/09/2026]
(e)an offence under regulation 10(2)(a) or 11(8)(a) or (b) of the Maintenance of Religious Harmony (Restraining Orders) Regulations 2026 (G.N. No. S 603/2026).
[S 605/2026 wef 15/09/2026]
